{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3d953d24d1a6c6b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# KServe\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: KServe\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n5\t**Owning team**: RHOAI Serving\n6\t**Upstream**: kserve/kserve\n7\t**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/kserve, red-hat-data-services/kserve\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tPrimary model serving stack. Deploys models as InferenceService CRs in two modes:\n13\tserverless (Knative + Istio) and raw deployment (plain Deployments/Services, no\n14\tmesh dependency). Raw deployment mode is the recommended path for disconnected\n15\tand edge environments.\n16\t\n17\t## Dependencies\n18\t\n19\t- Serving Runtimes (vLLM, OpenVINO, Caikit) for model execution\n20\t- Service Mesh / Serverless operators in serverless mode only\n21\t- Authorino for token authentication of inference endpoints\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- InferenceService CRD (serving.kserve.io/v1beta1); deployment state is exposed\n26\t  as CR status conditions (Ready, PredictorReady) and Kubernetes events\n27\t- Prometheus metrics per inference endpoint\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cd51f53f58a6d98","agent_id":"ae6b38f613648449c","session_id":"ca871b20-94d5-42d0-a66d-2838b98e5410","uuid":"425f3346-3754-4074-90aa-ea03f04e2877","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:21:11.291Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3d953d24d1a6c6b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020 into epics"}
